# 2026-09-27 — the backup loop's LEDGER-DROP record: which of his stores fell, from what, and the
# name of the backup that predates it. It names his backups and his route, so like every sibling
# runtime record above it is per-machine state and never source. The .tmp is the atomic-write
# partner; .unreadable-* is a damaged record the watcher set aside rather than write over.
tv/.ledger_drops.json
tv/.ledger_drops.json.tmp
tv/.ledger_drops.json.unreadable-*
